  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fond programutveckling och konsulttj&#xe4;nster 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund Programme Dev. and Consultancies 2012 - Presentation of LAPOP Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fonden f&#xf6;r programutveckling och konsulttj&#xe4;nster 2012 f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrar kvaliteten p&#xe5; genomf&#xf6;randet av Sveriges utvecklingssamarbete i Bolivia, genom det konsultst&#xf6;d och de sm&#xe5; strategiska insatser som finansieras av fonden. Bl.a. finansieras resultatanalys, studier, utv&#xe4;rderingar, metodutveckling via denna fond.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fund for Programme Development and Consultancies year 2012 improves the quality of the implementation of the Swedish development cooperation in Bolivia, through the consultancy support and small strategic contributions financed by the fund.For instance results analysis, studies and evaluations, technical assistance, and methods development is financed through this fund.</narrative>
  </description>
